➤ TP QUERY PLAN[12,0,0]  𝄀
Project  𝄀
  ->  Sort  𝄀
        Sort Key: l1_distance(t.v, ) INTERNAL, t.a INTERNAL  𝄀
        Limit: 3  𝄀
        ->  Table Scan on vec_optype_matrix.t
explain select a from t order by inner_product(v,'[1,1,1,1]') limit 3;
